htmx 2.0.10
Vendored file: htmx.min.js
Source: https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx/releases/tag/v2.0.10
License: Zero-Clause BSD (0BSD)

The shell ships two JavaScript files: this one, and shell.js (theme toggle
and htmx motion, deferred, at most 2048 bytes). The only inline script is
the theme bootstrap in the document head.

